ve Editing:** The agent can review, tweak, delete, or rewrite any part of the generated message.\\n- **1-Tap AI Tone Focus Presets:**\\n  - 🎯 **Meeting Slot Focus:** Confirms their preferred callback window (*Mon 1-2 PM*).\\n  - 💰 **5% Bonus & DROP Focus:** Re-engages around state pension analysis and growth.\\n  - 🏫 **Planning Period Focus:** Suggests connecting during their specific planning hour.\\n- **Zero-Cost Native SIM Handoff:** Tapping **\\\"Open in SMS App\\\"** launches your phone's native Message\n<truncated 386 bytes>","Description":"\"Walkthrough covering AI Persuasive SMS Engine and Editable Preview\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\brorm\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating walkthrough for AI SMS drafting\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough.md with AI SMS feature\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
